          "id": "PLENO-ANTENNA-SEGMENTATION",
          "severity": "required_feature_not_depicted",
          "finding": "Both antennae have ten mesh intervals but are geometrically smooth, straight, linearly tapered hexagonal tubes. No actual segment joint, annular relief, bend or material distinction exists. Exact final head detail shows continuous rods, while the original brief explicitly requires segmented antennae. Twenty separate ventral spines are present and do not substitute for antennal segments.",
